<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLBA0C9B06004" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Apron Side Member (Partial) Removal and Installation
</title>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
The figure below shows condition where the following parts are removed.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Front fender 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLBA0C9A06005"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Hood lock member and lamp support brace 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLBA0C9B06001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention3>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFBA0A9B0145.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "137.911mm" ver = "02" gw = "488" gh = "374"/>
</figure>
<servinfosub id = "AENLBA0C9B06004001">
<title>
General Notes
</title>
<ptxt>
Welding method and number of welding points are the same on both sides. This repair instruction shows procedure for left side.
</ptxt>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLBA0C9B06004002">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Drill out welding spots and remove front bumper member plate.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Drill out welding spots and remove apron side member extension.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILBA0A9B0008.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "171.718mm" ver = "01" gw = "467" gh = "470"/>
</figure>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLBA0C9B06004003">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<attention3>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Before conducting any weld, check installation position and condition for installation part(s), refer to 
<intxref refid = "AENLBA0C9B04004">Front Body Dimensions</intxref>
 and 
<intxref refid = "AENLBA0C9B04009">Underbody Dimensions</intxref>
.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Proceed repair while taking into consideration installation of parts that affect appearance. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLBA0C9B04003"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention3>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install apron side No.1 extension and apron side No.2 extension, apron side front No.1 reinforcement, apron side front No.2 reinforcement.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Conduct plug weld or resistance spot weld.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFBA0A9B0051.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "143.936mm" ver = "02" gw = "427" gh = "391"/>
<callout>
